{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-engineering","title":"特征工程","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.32,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"特征工程-简介\">特征工程 简介</h1><p>特征工程是机器学习和数据科学中最具实践价值的环节之一。业界有句名言：&quot;数据和特征决定了机器学习的上限，而模型和算法只是逼近这个上限。&quot;优秀的特征工程能力往往是区分初级和资深数据科学家的关键标志。</p>\n<p>本知识库系统讲解特征工程从基础到进阶的完整知识体系，面向数据科学家、机器学习工程师和算法工程师。</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>特征基础</strong>建立特征工程的基础认知，介绍特征工程的核心概念、数据类型编码方法和特征缩放与归一化技术。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>特征提取</strong>深入探讨如何从不同类型的原始数据中提取有价值的特征，涵盖数值、文本和时空三大数据类型的特征提取方法。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>特征选择</strong>讲解如何从大量候选特征中筛选出最有效的特征子集，包括过滤法、包装法、嵌入法和特征重要性评估等方法。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>特征管道</strong>聚焦特征工程的工程化实践，探讨特征存储、自动化特征工程和特征监控与漂移检测等生产级话题。</p>\n<p>建议读者按照章节顺序学习，从基础概念到提取方法，再到选择策略，最后掌握工程化的特征管道建设。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feature-basics","title":"特征基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feature-engineering-overview","title":"特征工程概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-basics/feature-engineering-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-types-encoding","title":"数据类型与编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-basics/data-types-encoding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-scaling-normalization","title":"特征缩放与归一化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-basics/feature-scaling-normalization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"feature-extraction","title":"特征提取","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-extraction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"numerical-feature-extraction","title":"数值特征提取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-extraction/numerical-feature-extraction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"text-feature-extraction","title":"文本特征提取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-extraction/text-feature-extraction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"temporal-spatial-features","title":"时间与空间特征提取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-extraction/temporal-spatial-features"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-selection","title":"特征选择","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-selection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"filter-methods","title":"过滤式特征选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-selection/filter-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wrapper-embedded-methods","title":"包裹式与嵌入式特征选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-selection/wrapper-embedded-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-importance","title":"特征重要性解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-selection/feature-importance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"feature-pipelines","title":"特征管道","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-pipelines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feature-store","title":"特征存储系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-pipelines/feature-store"},{"seq":2,"slug":"automated-feature-engineering","title":"自动化特征工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-pipelines/automated-feature-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-monitoring","title":"特征监控与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/feature-engineering/feature-pipelines/feature-monitoring"}]}]}